Package: sudo
Architecture: any
Depends: libpam-modules, ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Pre-Depends: sudo-common, ${misc:Pre-Depends}
Recommends: sudo-rs
Conflicts: sudo-ldap
Replaces: sudo-ldap
Multi-Arch: foreign
Description: Provide limited super user privileges to specific users
 Sudo is a program designed to allow a sysadmin to give limited root
 privileges to users and log root activity.  The basic philosophy is to give
 as few privileges as possible but still allow people to get their work done.

Package: libnss-sudo
Architecture: all
Depends: sudo-common, ${misc:Depends}
Multi-Arch: foreign
Description: NSS configuration for sudoers service
 This empty package provides the basic configuration needed to enable the
 `sudoers` NSS service.
